@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Moderator as User
boundary HalamanKelolaFeaturedUI as FeaturedUI
control FeaturedController as Controller
entity ArtikelProvider as Artikel

== Main Flow ==

User -> FeaturedUI : 1: Buka halaman kelola konten featured
activate FeaturedUI
FeaturedUI -> Controller : 1.1: muatDaftarFeatured()
activate Controller
Controller -> Artikel : 1.1.1: ambilDaftarFeatured()
activate Artikel
Artikel --> Controller : 1.1.2: Daftar konten featured saat ini
Controller --> FeaturedUI : 1.1.3: Data konten featured
FeaturedUI --> User : 1.1.4: Tampilkan daftar konten featured saat ini\ndan form untuk menambah featured

User -> FeaturedUI : 2: Pilih artikel dari daftar
User -> FeaturedUI : 3: Klik tombol Tambah ke Featured
FeaturedUI -> Controller : 3.1: tambahFeatured(artikelId)
Controller -> Artikel : 3.1.1: cekStatusFeatured(artikelId)
Artikel --> Controller : 3.1.2: Status artikel

alt [Artikel belum di-featured]
    Controller -> Artikel : 3.1.3: setFeatured(artikelId)
    Artikel --> Controller : 3.1.4: Featured berhasil
    Controller --> FeaturedUI : 3.1.5: Featured berhasil ditambahkan
    FeaturedUI --> User : 3.1.6: Notifikasi sukses
else [Artikel sudah di-featured]
    Artikel --> Controller : 3.1.2a: Artikel sudah di-featured
    Controller --> FeaturedUI : 3.1.3a: Error
    FeaturedUI --> User : 3.1.4a: Pesan "Artikel ini sudah di-featured"
end

deactivate Artikel
deactivate Controller
deactivate FeaturedUI

@enduml
